If a clinician does not understand a methadone-risk-profile then the clinician should not consider a methadone-treatment for a pain.
If a clinician does not prepare a patient-education then the clinician should not consider a methadone-treatment for a pain.
If a clinician does not prepare a patient-monitoring then the clinician should not consider a methadone-treatment for a pain.
If a clinician does not assess a QT-prolongation-risk then the clinician should not consider a methadone-treatment for a pain.
If a clinician does not consider an electrocardiographic-monitoring then the clinician should not consider a methadone-treatment for a pain.
